  "prefLabel": "Site 102.44 Scenic quality",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.44 “Scenic quality” means a reasonable person’s perception of the intrinsic beauty of landforms, water features, or vegetation in the landscape, as well as any visible human additions or alterations to the landscape.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15",
